{"type":"message","id":"50246261","parentId":"c76e0c29","timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:14:05.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Assessing Delays Persistently**\n\nThis is progressing slowly, I must admit. The researcher fallback strategy is proving crucial; the primary method is encountering hurdles. I'm leaning heavily on the `SOUL.md`'s alternative approaches, especially those utilizing `curl` with decrypt.co and coindesk.com feeds. Evaluating their efficacy is my priority now.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"process_1777641245239_7","name":"process","arguments":{"sessionId":"rapid-daisy","action":"poll","timeout":60000},"thoughtSignature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Monitoring For Failure**\n\nI'm keeping a close eye on the primary method; it's still running, albeit slowly. My patience is wearing thin, though. I'm preparing to trigger the `SOUL.md`'s fallback strategy using `curl` if the primary method times out. This timeout length adjustment is the key decision point I'm focused on right now.\n\n\n"}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":209,"output":130,"cacheRead":8502,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8841,"cost":{"input":0.00026125000000000003,"output":0.0013000000000000002,"cacheRead":0.00106275,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.002624}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777641230801,"responseId":"Eqf0abG8G-OBtrIPxZWg4Qk"}}
