{"type":"message","id":"de310f9b","parentId":"59c7dbec","timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:17:05.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Examining Access Block**\n\nI'm hitting a roadblock. The attempted web fetch returned a 403 error. That's a sign I'm blocked. Now I'm shifting gears, scouting the RSS feed for a different article – one I can actually access to dig into the deep facts.\n\n\n**Investigating Alternate Article**\n\nI'm switching to a different target now. Because of the access restrictions, I'm fetching a new article from the RSS feed. The \"Bitcoin Closes April\" piece is my new focus; I'll see if it is accessible.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"web_fetch_1777641425430_15","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://decrypt.co/366297/bitcoin-closes-april-up-12-as-strategys-mstr-posts-first-positive-month-since-july"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":36490,"output":209,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36699,"cost":{"input":0.0456125,"output":0.0020900000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0477025}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777641407164,"responseId":"waf0ab3uJoCWkNAPkc_90AI"}}
