{"type":"message","id":"38936cc2","parentId":"730db09b","timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:17:36.725Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering Network Obstruction**\n\nI'm facing a consistent roadblock with `decrypt.co`; `web_fetch` keeps failing. My contingency plan, outlined in `SOUL.md`, suggests alternative feeds like `coindesk.com`. I've already tested these alternatives, which might be helpful in future research steps.\n\n\n**Assessing Feed Alternatives**\n\nI'm still blocked by `decrypt.co`, as anticipated. So, I switched focus and am now assessing the viability of `coindesk.com` as a source. I'm initiating a `curl` command to retrieve content from their feed. Preliminary results look promising.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1777641456713_16","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s 'https://coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/'"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":1819,"output":164,"cacheRead":35100,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37083,"cost":{"input":0.00227375,"output":0.0016400000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0043875,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00830125}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777641436510,"responseId":"3qf0afySO9bRkNAPiuHYyAU"}}
