{"type":"message","id":"f5278e73","parentId":"d4c57d3f","timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:17:41.558Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Following the Redirect**\n\nI've hit a redirect. The initial `curl` attempt wasn't giving me the actual content, just a \"Redirecting...\" message. I remembered that `curl` needs a little nudge to follow those. Using the `-L` flag should fix it, and I'll see what the final URL looks like. I'll re-run it with `-sL` now.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1777641461529_17","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL 'https://coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/'"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":315,"output":82,"cacheRead":36766,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37163,"cost":{"input":0.00039375000000000006,"output":0.0008200000000000001,"cacheRead":0.00459575,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0058095}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777641457121,"responseId":"86f0aY3BJ--BtrIP_qag0Ag"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9da5286b","parentId":"f5278e73","timestamp":"2026-05-01T13:17:42.362Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_1777641461529_17","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<rss xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" version=\"2.0\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n    <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    <atom:link rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss\"/>\n    <atom:link rel=\"hub\" href=\"true\"/>\n    <description>Leader in cryptocurrency, Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP, blockchain, DeFi, digital finance and Web 3.0 news with analysis, video and live price updates.</description>\n    <lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 13:11:57 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en-US</language>\n    <copyright>© 2026 CoinDesk, Inc.</copyright>\n    <generator>CoinDesk</generator>\n    <ttl>5</ttl>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <url>https://downloads.coindesk.com/arc/failsafe/feeds/coindesk-feed-logo.png</url>\n      <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin bounces as big tech earnings fuel optimism; short-term pressures remain]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us/2026/05/01/bitcoin-bounces-as-big-tech-earnings-fuel-optimism-short-term-pressures-remain</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/89c32a08b136d6b401c989add9660c077b83de0e-2816x2112.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">52a9c322-987f-42c5-9360-ac6387382eb9</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:15:02 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Your day-ahead look for May 1, 2026]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Francisco Rodrigues</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/daybook-us\"><![CDATA[Crypto Daybook Americas]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Crypto Daybook Americas]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[SBI Holdings eyes stake in crypto exchange Bitbank to build digital asset powerhouse]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/01/sbi-holdings-continues-its-crypto-expansion-with-plans-for-a-stake-in-bitbank</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/25090ff126224815eb4859930f8912dbba7ec186-7952x5304.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">7a934846-ff65-40f5-9aeb-c33cf5b40776</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:11:32 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The Tokyo-based broker is betting big on crypto with plans in Singapore and a Visa partnership for bank cards that allows users to accumulate digital assets.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Japan]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Cryptocurrency]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item