e.\n\n\n**Creating the Command**\n\nI've successfully gathered the article's core details and organized them into the `RESEARCH_JSON` data structure.  I'm now generating the command for the writer agent, substituting the `RESEARCH_JSON` with the prepared data. I'm focusing on ensuring proper formatting and command execution. I'm preparing to clear the writer's session, before constructing and running the next instruction.\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_1777641510534_19","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/writer/sessions/sessions.json"},"thoughtSignature":""}],"api":"google-vertex","provider":"google-vertex","model":"gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":14006,"output":1130,"cacheRead":36662,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51798,"cost":{"input":0.017507500000000002,"output":0.011300000000000001,"cacheRead":0.00458275,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03339025}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777641484315,"responseId":"Dqj0aeTZOcm2trIP_oyd4Qs"}}
